  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "37\nA satellite is orbiting just above the surface of the earth with period T. If d is the density of the earth\nand G is the universal constant of gravitation, the quantity 3π/(Gd) represents :\n(1)\n√T\n(2)\nT\n(3)\nT²\n(4)\nT³\nGravitation\n",
